{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":488677,"name":"thomas2018","username":"thomas2018","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T08:16:43.413Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI created a webhook-triggered routine via the Bot. Opening the routine details on Windows desktop only shows: Enabled toggle, Instructions, “When a webhook fires”, empty run history. There is no gray box with the three click-to-copy fields (POST to URL, Secret crsr_…, Authorization header). Deep links for webhook-url/key/header also do not surface credentials. I am not on iOS—this is desktop 0.47.0. Recreating the routine does not help. The Bot cannot see or emit the URL/key, so external callers cannot use the webhook.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelated: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/webhook-url-missing-on-ios/169589\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eWebhook url missing on ios\u003c/a\u003e says credentials are desktop-only, but desktop still lacks the fields here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso filed in-app feedback requesting a reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk a Grok Bot to create a routine with webhook trigger type webhook.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Windows desktop Grok Bot, open agent → Routines → that routine.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve trigger text only; no POST URL / crsr_ / Authorization fields.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesktop trigger card shows POST URL, sender key, and Authorization header for copy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e0.47.0 x64\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSuspected Bot-created webhook routines may not provision credentials to the client so the UI block never mounts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-488677-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-488677-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T09:30:42.343Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":29,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":147.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"thomas2018","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/webhook-url-missing-on-ios/169589","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Webhook url missing on ios","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137284,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":488796,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T09:30:19.292Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and the link to the iOS thread.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou’re right, those fields are actually missing, and it’s not something on your end. New bots store their routines on the server (that’s the note saying “This Bot keeps its routines on the server” in the routine panel), and for these routines the desktop app currently doesn’t fetch or show the webhook URL, key, or Authorization header. Recreating the routine doesn’t change this, and the bot itself can’t provide those values either, so deep links open an empty panel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue we’re already tracking, and I’ve added your report to it. Unfortunately, there’s no way to get the URL or key for this kind of routine right now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs a temporary workaround, if you need to wake the bot from something external, Slack message triggers work right now (ask the bot to create a routine that runs when a message is posted in a channel you control) or you can use a schedule.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ll reply here when there’s an update.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T09:30:19.292Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":10,"readers_count":9,"score":37.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489531,"name":"","username":"phonebooth","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/9de053/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T12:56:57.706Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eRun into this exact same issue trying to have a bot action emails from Agent Mail as soon as they’re received (push to webhook). But don’t have access to the key to auth the push.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T12:56:57.706Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":1.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137471,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489614,"name":"","username":"Fern","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/f/b3f665/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T17:45:45.511Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThank you for update thought I was doing something wrong.  Desktop bug is on Mac as well. An update on the situation would be great. Webhook URL and key are nowhere to be found on both desktop versions or mobile app. I just want to know if I can wait for fix or do I have to transfer my accounts to slack paid plan on top of grok bot subscription. Is it an easy bug fix or could it take weeks?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T17:47:20.714Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137501,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489627,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:30:25.766Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks to both of you for the confirmations. \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/phonebooth\"\u003e@phonebooth\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/fern\"\u003e@Fern\u003c/a\u003e, yep, it’s the same issue, and it’s not on your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/fern\"\u003e@Fern\u003c/a\u003e, confirmed: it’s not Windows-only. Mac and mobile behave the same way. Same root cause: for newer bots, routines are stored on the server (the “This Bot keeps its routines on the server” note in the panel). For these routines, the client currently doesn’t fetch or show the Webhook URL, key, or Authorization header on any desktop app or in the mobile app. Recreating the routine doesn’t change anything, and the bot can’t return those values either.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re tracking this issue, and I’ve added your reports to it. I can’t share an exact timeline right now. I won’t promise “soon” or “weeks” since that wouldn’t be fair. When there’s an update, I’ll reply right here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor now, there’s no way to get the URL or key for this kind of webhook routine. If you need to wake the bot from something external, the working options right now are a Slack message trigger (ask the bot to create a routine that fires on a message in a channel you control) or a schedule. Nothing extra required on your side, just alternative triggers that are available today.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T18:30:25.766Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489660,"name":"thomas2018","username":"thomas2018","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T20:57:59.345Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/phonebooth\"\u003e@phonebooth\u003c/a\u003e  \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/fern\"\u003e@Fern\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFor currently usage, I’m using gateway at 127.0.0.1:1340 to send message to bot.  You can get more info by asking bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut please make sure don’t open this to WAN, this endpoint needs some kind of secure access methods, like SSH or VPNs.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T20:57:59.345Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":8,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"thomas2018","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":137501,"username":"Fern","name":"","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/f/b3f665/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137284,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/10","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489683,"name":"Robby Grossman","username":"Robby_Grossman","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/robby_grossman/{size}/120691_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T22:34:57.808Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI’m also blocked by this. Thanks \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/deanrie\"\u003e@deanrie\u003c/a\u003e for the rundown and in advance for letting us know when there’s a fix.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":11,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T22:34:57.808Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171324,"topic_slug":"desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0","display_username":"Robby Grossman","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137529,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/desktop-grok-bot-webhook-routine-shows-no-post-url-crsr-key-windows-0-47-0/171324/11","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[488677,488796,489531,489614,489627,489660,489683]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,2],[3,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id"